  "title": "United Bankshares Appoints Reilly Loflin as VP, Senior Fiduciary Wealth Advisor",
  "summary": "ATLANTA, GA – United Bankshares recently appointed Reilly Loflin as Vice President, Senior Fiduciary Wealth Advisor for its Wealth Management division. In this role, Loflin will manage client relationships across the Bank’s Greater Atlanta region, providing expert guidance on investment strategies, asset allocation, and advanced estate planning for high-net-worth clients.",
